  << /ActualText (User Interview 2 \024 Abhishek \050Early Career\054 Direction Seeking\051\nd Profile\n Name\072 Abhishek Sharma\n Age\072 24\n Role\072 Junior Ux Researcher\n Experience\072 1 year\n\nQ\072 How do you approach your career development\077\nA\072 I try to stay proactive\056 I read job descriptions and see what skills are required\046 but it\031s still a bit unclear what I should focus on\056\nQ\072 What platforms do you use\077\nA\072LinkedIn mostly\054 and sometimes Coursera\056 I also compare myself with others to see what they\031re doing\056\nQ\072 What challenges do you face\077\nThere\031s no clear path\056 Everyone says different things\056 Some say learn product development\054 others say focus on business skills\056\nQ\072 How do you decide what to learn\077\nA\072 That\031s the problem\046 I don\031t really know\056 I just pick something and hope it\031s useful\056\nQ\072 What would help you most\077\nA\072 A structured plan\056 Like\054 what should I learn in the next 3\0236 months to grow in my career and a pivot point from where I am right now\nQ\072 How do you feel about your current progress\077\nA\072 I feel like I could be doing more\046 but I\031m not sure what the right direction is\056)
